    "body": "The portfolio now offers “Bản gốc” and “Một nét” on one website through a persistent style switcher. Each version loads once and retains its demo data, form input, dialogs and scroll position when switching. Shared content, assets and demo rules stay in one private repository; the original source is also preserved by v1.1-current.\n\nThe “Một nét” version includes persistent HTML module morphing into the real demo, masked Vietnamese typography, SVG drawing, project preview transitions and feedback tied to actual data changes. The default first visit opens Bản gốc; URL parameters and a saved preference select either style. Keyboard arrows and browser history work with the switcher.\n\nValidation: build and six data/geometry tests pass. Browser checks verify state retention, form/dialog retention, keyboard, history/reload, rapid switching, mobile navigation and reduced motion. Both styles fit at 320/390/768/1440px. Previous motion checks and desktop/mobile videos remain documented in QA-ONE-LINE.md; the combined experience is documented in QA-SWITCHER.md.\n",
